      "label": "Pick the spot on the Map",
      "detail": "Tap “Use this spot” in the Map picker at the actor’s own managed city (Toronto, London or New York).",
      "reported": "local"
    },
    {
      "id": "publish-post",
      "label": "Publish the post",
      "detail": "Confirm “I can share this”, press “Post to TV”, wait for the upload to finish. This creates a real public post tagged synthetic.",
